# The board's directory is the context; only the kernel's inputs enter
# it. Not kernel/tests/ (host-side), not rootfs/firmware or the bring-up
# roots a board may keep under rootfs/ -- only the boot-logo master.
*
!bsp.env
!kernel/config/
!kernel/patches/
!kernel/dts/
!kernel/hooks/
!kernel/configure.sh
!kernel/build.sh
